# An X session on Dolly's display: the Xsdl server, twm managing the
# windows, and three of X's own clients in theirs: a clock, eyes that follow
# the pointer and a terminal with a shell, where imgui-x11 starts Dear ImGui's
# example in a window of its own.
FROM /v0.1.4/Dollyfile-system 0e41a43bd5c339eba2157cc3b47c588a203bffa712b1f6462f220fff0b980978
INSTALL /v0.1.4/demos/x11/Dollyfile-xorg-server 61d5c48631f56bfde15d17fe40a229d5f7dacb1254986309cfa618f9fa4b0347
INSTALL /v0.1.4/demos/x11/Dollyfile-twm 41ea2152b1eaefcd42ed0925baf7b5bbfe255cf9c97af735927f924fc0476a21
